<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <Description>Hyper-specific CDM/APM/ECM/SSM/ATRM models, recursive training pipeline with frozen judges, five-layer deterministic fallback stack, atomic hot-swap via statepoints. The symbolic fallback ships first.</Description>
